<title>UK: Albert Fisher to sell N.American business.</title>
<headline>Albert Fisher to sell N.American business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food company Albert Fisher Group Plc said it is to sell its North American produce distribution business to a company controlled by New York-based merchant banking firm Rosecliff Inc for 73.5 million stg.</p>
</text>
